 (semi-rare)</li>\n<li>Northwind Rod (rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td style=\"width: 100px; text-align: center\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Overlord\"><img alt=\"Massive Water Elemental\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"48\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Massive_Water_Elemental_91705b.gif\" width=\"47\"/></a></span></span><br/><a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Overlord\">Ice Overlord</a></td><td style=\"width: 38px; text-align: center;\">2,800</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4,000</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">1408+</td><td style=\"font-size: small;\"><div class=\"loot-table\" id=\"w-loot_perc_loot\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Flawless%20Ice%20Crystal\">Flawless Ice Crystal</a> (always)</li>\n<li>1-75× <a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></li>\n<li>1-3× <a href=\"#/wiki/Platinum%20Coin\">Platinum Coin</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Crystalline%20Armor\">Crystalline Armor</a> (very rare)</li>\n</ul>\n</div></td></tr>\n</tbody></table></div>","quests":[]}